[h1]1.4 - 1.3 Compatibility & Bug Fixes[/h1]

[h2]1.3 Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Updated supported_game_version to 1.3.*
[*]All mod triggers and effects verified against EU5 1.3.6 game files
[*]Added [b]Celtic marriage ban[/b] support: respects the [i]country_celtic_marriage_banned[/i] modifier from the Lordship of Ireland "Gaelic Rule" law. Auto-marriages will no longer pair Celtic and non-Celtic characters when the ban is active.
[*]Added [b]blocked_from_character_interactions[/b] check: characters blocked from interactions by the game are now excluded from auto-marriage candidate pools
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Fixed NULL marriage bug[/b]: crown estate marriage events (57/58/59) now double-wrap both scopes with null-safe operators, preventing "NULL marries NULL" notifications
[*][b]Fixed culture restriction mismatch[/b]: triggers and effects now consistently apply culture checks. Previously, triggers could find characters of any culture while effects filtered by culture, causing events to fire with no valid match and producing daily notification spam. All 16 trigger blocks and 15 effect female blocks now include the culture check.
[/list]

[h2]Translations[/h2]
[list]
[*]Added [b]Turkish[/b] translation (thanks to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/id/steambecel]Ligarset[/url])
[/list]
